  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.75</data>
  <data key="d37">Sustained higher global oil prices raise Russia's export revenues and fiscal room for munitions, logistics and mobilization, enabling higher operational tempo and sustainment on the Ukrainian front.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
