  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Sustained higher oil prices increase government and national energy-company revenues, enabling sovereign wealth funds and state-linked firms to redirect capital into strategic tech and space-communications projects.</data>
