  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">A sustained rise in oil prices raises inflation expectations and risk premia, prompting investors and allocators to reweight portfolios away from long‑duration, high‑growth tech projects into commodity/energy exposures and shorter‑duration instruments, reducing net new capital flowing into AI build‑out.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
