  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">A spike in perceived Middle East supply-disruption risk triggers reallocation of NATO/Western naval and air assets to protect shipping lanes and energy infrastructure, reducing deterrent posture or political bandwidth in Europe and creating openings for Russian escalation.</data>
