  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Rising reciprocal mistrust among states increases perceived geopolitical and counterparty risk, causing institutional investors and governments to delay or withdraw funding from large cross-border space-communications projects and reallocate capital to lower-risk alternatives.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_conflict</data>
  <data key="d40">space_comm_governance</data>
