<edge source="space_comm_governance::capital_allocation_rate" target="mid_east_energy::shipping_bottleneck_inde" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher rates of capital committed to space and communications projects expand satellite-based vessel tracking and broadband backhaul capacity, enabling better traffic management and reducing maritime congestion and port turnaround times.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
