  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">A sustained increase in capital directed into large space‑communications projects diverts venture and corporate funding pools and balance‑sheet commitments away from AI buildouts, reducing net new investment into AI in the near term as LPs and corporates re‑allocate to meet space project cash needs.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">space_comm_governance</data>
  <data key="d40">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
</edge>
