  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">A sustained increase in capital allocated to large domestic space/communications projects diverts institutional and private savings away from sovereign bonds, reducing demand and pushing long-term sovereign yields higher.</data>
