  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">Improvements in military communications reliability reduce perceived operational and geopolitical risk, weakening investor demand for safe‑haven assets during risk episodes.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">space_comm_governance</data>
