<edge source="space_comm_governance::regulatory_scrutiny" target="mid_east_energy::shipping_bottleneck_inde" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Heightened regulatory investigations or license suspensions of satellite communications providers can cause temporary outages or capacity reductions for maritime comms/AIS services, producing immediate increases in route miscoordination and port/terminal delays.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">space_comm_governance</data>
  <data key="d40">mid_east_energy</data>
</edge>
<edge source="space_comm_governance::regulatory_scrutiny" target="russia_ukraine_conflict::negotiation_activity" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Tightened export controls, licensing reviews, or investigatory actions around space-communications services create cross-border commercial disputes and service access problems that compel states and intermediaries to enter diplomatic negotiations to resolve access, exemptions, or sanctions implications.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">space_comm_governance</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_ukraine_conflict</data>
</edge>
<edge source="space_comm_governance::regulatory_scrutiny" target="us_china_tech_rivalry::supply_chain_frictions" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">Heightened regulatory investigations and export licensing of space‑communications hardware and ground systems triggers more export controls, customs checks and de‑risking by suppliers, producing immediate delays and substitution in overlapping AI hardware and component supply chains.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">space_comm_governance</data>
  <data key="d40">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
</edge>
<edge source="space_comm_governance::regulatory_scrutiny" target="western_bond_volatility::capital_outflow_rate" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Heightened regulatory scrutiny of space/communications firms prompts foreign and domestic investors to liquidate positions and repatriate capital to avoid enforcement and legal uncertainty, raising net capital outflows.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">space_comm_governance</data>
